    // fires within: the chin turret wide, missiles and pods fixed). Only a pad's or a station's rearm refills them
    // (noResupply). Ranges are game ranges (the Kornet reaches 28.8 cells, the rifle 5): the cannon 20 cells, the
    // pods 25, the missiles 40. Placeholders tuned in the tests (HelicopterTests).
