    // The attack helicopter's 30 mm chin cannon (an M230 type) on a turret slaved to its target (110 degrees either side of
    // the nose): a burst every half second, 30 damage through heli_cannon (soldiers, light vehicles and trucks 100%,
    // armour 25%) with a small splash (0.8 cell) scattered up to 0.8 cell: about 60 damage a second on soldiers, a
    // technical (180) in 3 s. 60 bursts.
