    // (3 minimum) at 40 cells/s, guided by its own seeker for 60 cells of flight (60 degrees a second). Fired with a line of
    // sight a crest still stops it (the pop-up); at a vehicle its own mast radar tracks it locks on after launch
    // (lockAfterLaunch): fired from behind cover, it lofts over the crest. A ripple: one at its target, then one each at up
    // to 3 more vehicles it may fire at within 30 degrees of the nose (its seeker turns onto them), 0.25 s apart (ripple: 4
    // targets a pop-up), then the 2 s reload. Fixed on the wings: 15 degrees of the nose. A small runway crater.
    { "id": "heli_missiles", "requires": ["helicopter"],
      "effects": [{ "weapon": { "runway": { "crater": "small" }, "damage": 500, "range": 400, "minRange": 30, "reload": 40, "warhead": "heli_missile",
                                "splash": 10, "projectileSpeed": 400, "targets": ["ground"], "ammo": 10, "ammoPerRocket": true, "noResupply": true, "apsThreat": true,
